**Find Maximum/Minimum** — In array/list
____________________________________________
// Method 1: Using Collections
int[] arr = {5, 2, 9, 1, 7};
int max = Collections.max(Arrays.asList(5, 2, 9, 1, 7));  // 9
int min = Collections.min(Arrays.asList(5, 2, 9, 1, 7));  // 1

// Method 2: Using Stream API (Java 8+)
int[] arr = {5, 2, 9, 1, 7};
int max = Arrays.stream(arr).max().orElse(0);  // 9
int min = Arrays.stream(arr).min().orElse(0);  // 1

// Method 3: Loop (for primitives, faster)
int[] arr = {5, 2, 9, 1, 7};
int max = arr[0];
for (int num : arr) {
    if (num > max) max = num;
}
System.out.println(max);  // 9
